              "text": "el finiquito — \"the final settlement, the severance pay\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Cobró el finiquito al dejar la empresa. He got his final settlement when he left the company."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The money owed to a worker when a job ends, and the paper that settles it."
            }
          ]
        },
