          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "finiquito is built on finiquitar 'to settle an account', usually traced to the old phrase fin y quito 'end and quit'. Fin comes from Latin fīnis 'end'."
            }
          ]
        },
